      "arithmetic": [
        "Clear side = 699 - 200 = 499; area = 499 x 499 = 249,001 mm2 < 250,000 -> keep + warning.",
        "Centreline 699 x 699 = 488,601.",
        "Display label 0.249001 m2 -> '0.25', which is why the warning must use the unrounded value, not the label."
